      "PEPPER: You'11 just get us all in trouble again. I'm gonna tell, Annie.\nANNIE: And I'll rearrange your teeth.\nHANNIGAN: What're you standing around for? You have to do the kitchen and the bathroom before lunch, my little pig droppings, and if you skip the corn…\nHANNIGAN: . And we're not having hot mush today.",
      "PEPPER: Helping you.\nHANNIGAN: Like what? Lemme see in that --"
